<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="HOS" style="id">Hosia</book>
  <para style="h">Hosia</para>
  <para style="toc1">Hosia</para>
  <para style="toc2">Hosia</para>
  <para style="mt">Hosia</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Judah kumpipate, Uzzia, Jotham, Ahaz, Hezekiah leh Israel kumpipa, Joas tapa Jeroboam damlai a, Beeri tapa Hosia kiang ah hongtung Toupa thu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hosia zang a Toupa’n thu a gen masak lai in, Hosia kiang ah Toupa’n , kuan inla, kizuakmi na zi ding in pi in kizuakmi tate: gam in kizuakna nakpitak in a hihta hi. Toupa a kipan paikhia in, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huchi in a kuan a Diblaim tanu Gomer a pi a; a hong gai a, tapa a neihsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Huan Toupa’n a kiang ah, “A min Jezreel sa in; sawtlou nung chiang a, Jehu inkaw tung a Jezreel sisan phuba la ding ka hi, Israel inkaw lalgam ka tawpsak ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huai ni chiang in hichi a honghi ding a, Jezreel guam ah Israel thalpeu ka kitansak ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huan a gai nawn a, tanu a nei hi. Toupa’n a kiang ah, “A min ding in Lo-ruhama sa in: amaute bangchi mah a ngaidam ding in, Israel inkaw tung ah chitna ka neih nawnlouh ding ziak in” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Himahleh Judah inkaw tung ah chitna ka nei ding a, Toupa a Pathian un amaute ka hondam ding a, thalpeu, namsau, kidouna, sakol, sakol tungtuangmite in amau ka hondam kei ding hi, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huan Lo-ruhama nawitui a ngawlhsak in, a gai nawn a, tapa a nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pathian in “A min ding in Lo-ammi sa in: ka mite na hihlouh ua, na Pathian uh ka hihlouh ding ziak in” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hinapi in Israel suante zah tuipi piaunel, tehtheihlouh, simtheih louh bang ahi ding; a kiang ua, “Ka mite na hi kei uh” chih a a omna mun uah, hichi ahi ding a, “Pathian hing tate na hi uh,” a kiang ua chih ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huchi in Judah suante leh Israel suante kaihkhawm ahi ding ua, amau ading in lu khat a kiguan ding ua, gam a kipan a kuantou ding; Jezreel ni thupi ding ahi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Na unaute uh, Ammi kiang ah gen un; na sanggamnute uh, Ruhama kiang ah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Na nu uh genpih un, genpih un; ka zi ahi kei a, a pasal ka hi sam kei hi; a maitang a kipan a kizuaknate leh a nawi kikal a kipan a angkawmnate koihmang hen;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huchilou in zaw vuaktang in ka omsak in, a pianni bang in ka koih in, gamdai bang in ka bawl in, gamkeu bang in ka koih in, dangtakna in amah ka that kha ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ahi, a tate tung ah chitna ka neikei ding a; kizuak tate a hih ding ziak un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A nu uh kizuak a hih ziak in; amaute painu’n zumhuaitak in ahihta hi; “Ka tanghou leh ka tui, ka samul leh ka pat, ka sathau leh ka dawn ding honpia, ka itte ka delh ding” a chih ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huaiziak in, ngai in, ling in a lampi ka dal dia, amah dal ding in dai ka kai dia, huchi in a lampite a mu kei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huchi in a itte a nungzuih ding a, himahleh a pha kei ding; amau a zong ding a, himahleh a mu kei ding; “Ka pai dia ka pasal masapen kiang ah ka kik ding; huaichiangin tu sang in kei ding in a hoihzaw ding” a chi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A buh leh bal, uain, sathau ka piak leh, a dangka leh a dangkaeng, Baal adia a zat uh, ka hih pungsak chih a theihlouh ziak un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huaiziak in buh leh bal a lak hun in ka la nawn ding, ka uain a hun in, a vuaktanna khuhna ding ka samul leh ka pat ka botkhe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huchi in tu’n amah itte muh in a zahlakna ka mukhe ding a, ka khut a kipan kuamah in amah a tankhe kei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A vualnopna tengteng ka tawpsak ding a, a ankuangluite, a kha thak, a khawlni, leh a khawmpi kulmut tengteng;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hiaite ka kipahman ka itte’n kei a honpiak uh ahi, a chihna, a grepguite leh a theipi kungte ka suse vek ding huchi in gammang in ka bawl ding a, gamsate’n huaite a ne ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Baalim ni, huaite a gimlim halnite amah tung ah ka kan ding a; a bilbahte leh a suangmantamte a kizem a, a it a zuih a, kei a hon mangngilh ziak in, Toupa’n a chi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huaiziak in, ngai in, amah ka khim ding a, gamdai ah ka tonpih ding a, a kiang ah lungmuanhuai tak in thu ka gen ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Huan huai a kipan in a grephuante amah ka pe ding a, lametna kongkhak ding in Akor guam; huan a tuailai nite bang in, Aigupta gam a kipan a a hongpawt khiak lai ni bang in huai ah aman la a sa ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Huai ni chiang in hichi ahi ding hi, Ishi n’on chita dia; Baali n’on chi nawnta kei ding, Toupa’n a chi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A kam a kipan Baalim minte ka lamangta ding a, a min uh genkhiak a hih nawn taklouh ding ziak un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Huai ni chiang in, gamsate, van vasate, lei a bokvak a pai thilte toh amau ading in thukhun ka bawl ding; thalpeu leh namsau leh kidouna gam a kipan ka hihmangta ding a, galmuangtak in amau ka kualsak ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Huan kei ading in tangtawn in nang k’on khamta ding; ahi, diktatna leh vaihawmna leh, itna siamna leh chitna in kei a ding in nang k’on kham ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ginomna in kei ading in k’on kham ding a; Toupa na thei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Huai ni chiang in hichi a honghi ding a, ka dawng ding, vante ka dawng ding a, amau lei a dawng ding uh, Toupa’n a chi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Lei in buh leh bal leh, uain leh, sathau in a dawng ding a, Amau Jezreel a dawng ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Huan lei ah kei din amah ka tuh ding a; chitna tanglounu tung ah chitna ka musak ding; ka mite hiloute kiang ah, “Ka mite na hi uh” ka chi ding a; amau, “Ka Pathian na hi” a honchi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Toupa’n ka kiang ah, “Kuan inla, a lawm in a lunggulh tuntun numei, angkawmnu, pathian dangte lam nga in, grepbeu gamte it mahle uh, Toupa’n Israel suante a it bang in it nawn in” a honchi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Huchi in kei a din amah dangka sekel sawmlehnga leh, Barli buh homer khat leh, barli buh homer kimkhat in ka leita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A kiang ah, kei ading in ni tampi na om nilouh ding; kizuak in na om nawn kei ding a, mi kuamah zi na hi kei ding; huchibang in keileng nang lam ah ka om ding, ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Israel suante bel kumpi neilou, vaihawmmi omlou, kithoihna neilou, khuam siangthou lou, siampu puanak lou, leh pathiante lou in ni tampi om nilouh ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huai nungchiang in Israel suante a hongkik nawn ding ua, Toupa , a Pathian uh, leh David a kumpipa uh a zong ding uhi; ni nanungte ah Toupa kiang ah a hoihna zuan in lau kawm in a hongpai ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nou Israel suante, Toupa thu za un: “Gamsung a thutak a omlouh a, Pathian theihna a omlouh ziak in, gam a tengte Toupa’n a kinakpih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kichiam leh ginna hihsiat, thah, guktak, leh angkawm hih chih ngallouh bangmah a omkei hi; a ki tungkhia ua, sisan a kisuah zialzial uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huaiziak in, gam a dah ding a, asung a tengte leh gamsate leh tungleng vasate a bah ding ua, ahi, tuipi ngasate tengteng a mangthang ding uhi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Hinapiin kuamah in sual kei henla, kuamah in sal kei heh; na mite siampute kisualpihte bang ahi uh” chih Toupa thupawt ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huan sun in na kisui ding a, nang toh zawlnei leng zan in a kisui ding uhi; huchi in na nu ka hihse ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka mite theihna taksap ziak in hihsiat in a om ua; theihna na deih louh ziak in, ken leng, kei dia siampu na hih louhna ding in k’on sam kei ding; na Pathian dan na mangngilhta chih thei in, ken leng na suante ka mangngilh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“A hongpun bangzel un, ka tung ah thil a hihkhial uhi; a thupina uh zumna in ka khek ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka mite khelhna kivakna’n a nei ua, a thulimlouhna uah a lungtang uh a koih kip uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huan mipite hi in siampute a kibang ua, a tatdante uh ziak in amau ka gawt ding, a thilhihte uah kipahman ka pe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A ne ding ua, a kham kei ding uh; a kizuak ding ua, a pung kei ding uh; Toupa lam a pilvang dia a awlmoh louh ziak un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Toupa’n “Kizuakna leh uain leh uain thak in theihtheihna a lamang hi! a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka mite’n a milimte uh thu a dong ua, a kiang uah a aisan in thu a genkhia hi; angkawmna kha in amaute takhial sak in, a Pathian uh nuai a kipan angkawm in a omta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mualvumte tung ah a kithoih ua, tangte tung leh, tosaw singte leh a hiang singte leh nainei singte nuai ah, huai nuailim a hoih ziak in, gimlim a hal uh; huaiziak in na tanute un kizuakna a hih ua, na moute un kizuakna a hih ua; na moute un angkawmna a hih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Na tanute un a kizuak chiang un ka gawt kei ding a, na jite un ang a kawm chiang leng un ka gawt kei ding a; pasalte kizuakna a paizak ua, tempula kizuakte kiang ah a kithoih uh; ‘huchi in theihna neilou mite nuaisiah in a om ding uhi.’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Nang Israel in, kizuakna hihmah leteh, Judah ahihleh mawh kei hen, Gilgal ah hongpai kei unla, Bethaven ah leng hohtou sam kei un, Toupa a hing bang in chi in kichiam kei un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Bawngla genhak bang in, Israel genhak tak in a kibawla; mun za a belamnou bang in tuin Toupa’n amaute a vak ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ephraim milimte toh a kizom a; a omom in om hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A dawnkham nung un leng kizuak in a om lailai ua, thupina sang in zumhuaina a it tuntun uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Huih in a kha in amaute mutmang ding a, a kithoihna ziak un a zum ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nou siampute aw, hiai za un, nou Israel inkawte, ngaikhia un, kumpipa inkawte aw, bildoh un, vaihawmna na tung ua hongtung ding hi; Mizpah a thang leh, Tabor tung a lenthang na hikhinta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mithahna lam ah thukpi in a kihelta ua; himahleh amaute tengteng thuhilhpa ka hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ephraim ka thei a, Israel ka lak ah sel in a omkei; Ephraim aw, tuin, kizuak in na omta a, Israel a buahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A thilbawlte un a Pathian kiang lam a ngasak kei ding hi; asung uah kizuakna kha a om a, Toupa a theikei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Israel kisaktheihna in a ma ah a theihpih a; huaiziak in Israel leh Ephraim a thulimlouhna uah a kisui ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Toupa zong ding in a bawnghonte uh leh a belamhonte utoh a kuan ding ua; himahleh amah a mu kei ding uh; amau a kipan in a ki hemkheta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Toupa tung ah lepchiahtak in a gamta ua; ta lamdangte a nei ua; tuin a loute uh toh kha thak in amau a negai ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Gibeah ah na pengkulbinei uh mut inla, Ramah ah pengkul; Bethaven ah, nanung ah; Aw Benjamin, lauthawngna gingsak un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Salhna ni’n Ephraim a segawp ding a; a hongom ngeingei ding Israel namte lak ah ka theisakta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Judah heutute gamgi chiamtehna lamangte hi uh; tuibang in ka hehna a tung uah ka sungbaw ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Epraim nuaisiah in a om, vaihawmna ah delhkhumin a om hi, thupiak zui a om a lungkim ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huaiziak in Ephraim ading in puannget leh Judah inkawte ading in siatna ka hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ephraim in a chinatna a muh a, Judah in a liamna a muh chiang in, huaichiang in Ephraim bel Assuria kiang ah a hohta a kumpipa Jareb kiang ah a sawlta hi; himahleh nang a hon hihdam theikei a, na liamna leng a hihdam thei sam kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ephraim ading a humpinelkai bang leh, Judah inkawte adia humpinelkai tuailai bang ka hih ziak in; kei, kei mahmah in, ka botnen dia ka paimang ding; ka pawmang ding a; honkhe ding kuamah a omkei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A tatkhelhna uh thupha a tawi ua, ka mel a zon masiah uh, ka pai dia ka mun ah ka kiknawn ding; a gimthuakna uah chihtaktak in kei a honzong ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hong un, Toupa kiang ah i kik ding uh; aman a hon botkekta a, a hon damsak ding ziak in, a honsat a, a hontuam ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ni nih nung in aman a hon hihhalh ding; ni thum ni’n a hon kaithou ding a, a ma ah i hing ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huan thei ni, Toupa thei ding in zuitou pek ni; zingsang a khua a vak ngeingei bang in leh vuah, lei kawtsak vuah nanung bang in i kiang uah a hongpai ding chih theihsa ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aw Ephraim, bang k’on chih dia? Aw Judah, bang k’on loh dia? Na hoihna lah zingsang meipi bang leh daitui zulmang pah bang ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huaiziak in zawlneite in amaute ka heuhta; ka kam a thute in amaute ka thatta hi: na vaihawmnate khovak paikhe pah bang ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kithoihna hilou in, chitna ka deih a; haltum thillat sang in Pathian theihna ka deih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Himahleh Adam bang in thukhun ah a talek ua: huai ah lepchiahtak in ka tung ah a hih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Gilead thulimlou sepna khopi ahi a, sisan a hihnit in a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Suamhat pawlte’n mi a guktan bang un, siampu pawlte’n Sekem zotna lampi ah tual a that uh; ahi, kilawmlou a hihta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Israel inkawte ah thil mulkimhuai ka muta a: huai ah Ephraim ah kizuakna muh in a om a, Israel a buahgawpta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huailou in, Aw Judah, ka mite saltang ka pinawn chiang in, nang ading in buhlak ding sehsa a om hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel ka sukdam chiang in, huai chiang in Ephraim thulimlouhna muhkhiak ahi, Samaria gitlouhna toh; zuauthei ahi ngal ua: gutate’n inn a luh ua, a pawlam ah suamhatte’n mite a suam uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A gitlouhna tengteng uh ka theigige chih a lungtangte un a ngaihtuah kei uh: tuin amau thilhihte ngei in amaute a hihbuai hi; tuate ka mai ma ah a om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A gitlouhna un a kumpipa uh a kipaksak ua, a zuau un a heutute uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Avek un angkawmte ahi uh; thuk sa gige, tanghou kangmi in tangbuang mekman silngou in a zelh suah masiah meisawn kullou thuk bang ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />I kumpipa uh ankuangluini in heutute uain sa in amau leh amau a ki china sak ua; simmohhatte toh a khut a zankhia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A lungtang uh thuk khuk sa bang ahi a, mite zuau in a buk ua, zankhua in a hehna uh a am a zingsang in meikuang bang in a kuangkhia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Thuk bang in a sa vek ua, a vaihawmmite uh a negai uh; a kumpipa tengteng uh a pukta uh: kei lam a hong patau kuamah a omkei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ephraim, mite lak ah a kidiaha; lumleh louh tanghou beu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mikhualte’n a hatna a gai ua, aman a theikei: ahi, a lutung koi lailai hiam a samkang a omlam a theikei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huan Israel kisaktheihna a mel ah a lang hi: Toupa a Pathian lam ah a kihei kei ua, hiai tengteng ziak in, Amah a zong tuankei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ephraim vakhu hai bang, theihsiamna bei ahi; Aigupta lam ah a sam ua, Assuria kiang ah a pai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A pai chiang un, a tung uah len ka zak ding; van a vasate bang in amau ka kaikhe suk ding: ka sawi ding a, a khawmpi un a zaksa bang un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A tung uh a gik hi; kei a kipan a taimang ziak un, a tung uah siatna a tung hi, keimah tung ah a talekta ua; a maute tankhe ut mah leng, ka siatna ding in zuau a gengen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A lungtang utoh ka kiang ah a kap kei ua, a lupna tung uah a kap zawsop uh: buh leh bal leh uain zong in a kikaikhawm ua, ka tung ah a hel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A khut uh sinsakin hatsakta mah leng, ka siatna ding in a ngaihtuah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A kik ua, himahleh tungsanga ompa kiang ah ahi kei; thalpeu gilou bang ahi uh: a lei hehna ziak in namsau in a heutute uh a puk ding uh: Aigupta gam ah hiai nuihsana a omna uh ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Na kam ah pengkul bulh in, muvanlai bang in Toupa inkawte dou ding in a hong hi: ka thukhun tung a a tatlek ua, ka dan a a tatlek ziak un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka Pathian, kou Israel in k’on thei uh, chi in, kei lam ah a kikou khe ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Israel in a hoih a nawlkhin a: melma in amah a delh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kumpipate a tungkhia ua, himahleh kei thu in bel a hi kei hi; heutute a bawl ua, ken ka theikei: satkhiak a a om theihna ding un a dangka uleh a dangkaeng un milimte a bawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aw Samaria, na bawngnou milim in hon satkheta; amaute tung ah ka hehna a sou: hoihna a tunma un bang tan hi ding ahia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Bawngnou milim Israel a kipan in ahi a: nasemmite’n a bawlkhiak uh ahi, huai Pathian ahi kei, ahi, Samaria bawngnou milim a kitam zan ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huih a tuh ua pingpei a at ua, buh leh bal ding lai a neikei; a vui in an a suah kei hi; huchi ahihleh suah hen, mikhualte’n a nawmvalh khin ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Israel nawmvalh in a om, kipahna omlouhna bel bang in tuin namte lak ah a om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Gam sabiltung tangom bang in, Assuria zuan in a paitou uhi: Ephraim in itmite a guaita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ahi, namte lak a kizuak mahle uh, amaute ka kaikhawm ding; heutute kumpipa dangte puakgik ziak in a lungkham ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Khial ding a Ephraim in maitam a punsak ziak in, amah adin maitamte khelhna ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Amah ading in ka danthuseh sang sawm in gelh mah leng, thil lamdang bang a sim in a om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka thillatte kithoihna thu ahihleh, sa in a kithoih ua a ne uh; himahleh Toupa’n huaite a sang kei hi; tuin a gitnatlouhna uh a theigige ding a, a khelhnate un a veh ding; Aigupta ah a kik ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Israel in amah bawlpa a mangngilh a, munsangte a lamta hi: himahleh a khopite tung ah mei ka sawl ding a, huai a kulhpite a kangtum ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw Israel, midangte bang in nuamsa in kipak ken; Pathian a kipan in kizuak in na omkhinta ngal a, phual tung teng ah kizuakman na itta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Phual leh uain suknate’n amau a vak kei ding a, uain thak in amah a zuausan ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Toupa gam ah a tengkei ding ua; himahleh Ephraim Aigupta ah a kik ding, Assuria ah an sianglou a ne ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Toupa kiang ah uain thillatte a sungkhe kei ding ua, amah ading in lungkimhuai ahi sam kei ding uh: a kithoihnate uh amau ading in sisunmite tanghou bang ahi ding; huai ne tengteng hihnit in a om ding uh; a tanghou uh a gilkialna uh ading ahi; Toupa inn sung ah a hongpai kei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kikhawmpi chik leh Toupa Ankuanglui ni’n bang na hih ding ua?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ngai un, Assuria ah a pai ding uh; Aigupta in amau a khawm ding, Memphis in amau a vui ding. Dangka a bawl a gou manphate uh lahou in a khuh ding; a puaninte uah lingte a om ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Vehna nite a hongtung, thukna nite a hongtung; Israel in a thei ding hi zawlnei mihai a seh ahi a, khamite leng mihai ahi, na ginatlouhna a tam mahmah ziak in leh muhdahna a thupi ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ephraim galvilmi Pathian toh a om hi; zawlnei tungtang ahihleh a lampi tengteng ah thangkampa thang a om a, muhdahna Pathian inn ah a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Gibeah nite a bang in, nakpi’n amau leh amau a kihihsia ua: a thulimlouhna uh a theigige ding a, a khelhnate uh a gawt ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Gamdai a grepte bang in Israel ka mu a; theipi kung a hun masapen lai a min masa bang in na pipute uh ka muta hi. Himahleh Baal-peor ah a hong ua, thil zumhuai lam ah a kipumpiak ua, a thil deihte uh bang in amaute kihhuai a hong hita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ephraim ahihleh, vasa bang in a thupina uh a leng mang ding a: naupianna, naupaina leh nau neihna himhim a omkei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A tate uh khoi lian mahle uh, amau ka sunsak ding a, piching a hawi in a omkei ding hi: ahi, amaute ka nutsiat hun chiang in a tung uah a tunggikna a om ding hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ephraim, Tura ka muhsa bang in, mun nuam a phuh in a om: himahleh Ephraim in a tate tualthatmi kiang ah a hon pikhe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Aw Toupa amau pia in; bang na pedia? Sul naupai theilou leh nawi zu neilou pia in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A gitlouhna tengteng uh Gilgal ah a om a; huai ah amau ka mudahta hi; a thilhihte uh gitlouh ziak in ka inn a kipan amau ka delhkhe ding: Ka it nawn kei ding a; a heutute tengteng uh mihel ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ephraim sat in a om, a zung uh a keu, gah a suang kei ding uh; tate suang mahle uh, a sulgah it uh ka that ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ka Pathian in amau a paimang ding a, amah a ngaihkhiak louh ziak uh; huchi in namte lak ah vakvai in a om ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel in gahtam a suahzel, grepgui pha ahi; a gahtam mahmah dungzui in a maitamte a pungsak; a gam hoihna dungzui in milim kilawm taktak a bawl uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A lungtang uh a kikhen a; huchi in mawhtansak in a om ding uh; a maitamte uh a sat ding a, a khuamte uh a lok ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kumpipa i neikei uh; Toupa i kihta kei ua; kumpipa leng, ei ading in bang a hihthei dia, tuin a chi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Thukhunte bawlna a zuau a kichiam in, thu bangloute a gen ua; huaiziak in loulehsa a namtul bang in vaihawm na a poukhe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Beth-aven bawngnoute ziak in Samaria a tengteng a lau ding ua; huai mite’n siampu a tung a kipakte a sun ding uhi, huai bawngnou ziak in thupina amah a kipan a paimangtak ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kumpipa Jareb kiang a thilpiak ding a Assuria lam a puak ahilai ding a, Ephraim in zahlakna a mu dia, Israel amah pilna ah a zahlak ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Samaria bel tui tung a tuiphuan bang in a kumpipa satkhiak ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aven mun sangte leng, Israel khelhna hihsiat ahi ding, ling leh loulingnei a maitam tung uah a hong kahtou ding a; mualte kiang ah, “honkhuh un; tangte kiang ah hon pukkhum un,” a chi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aw Israel, Gibeah nite a kipan na khialta a; huai ah ading ua; Gibeah thulimlouhna tate tung a kidouna in amaute a phak louhna ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka hun chiang in, amaute ka sawi ding; a tatlekna uh thuah nih ziak a taihilh a hih hun chiang un, amau dou ding in mite a kikhawm ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huan Ephraim bawngla chilsiamsa, buh leh bal chilkhiak ut ahi; himahleh a ngawng kilawm tung ah hakkol ka bat dia, Ephraim tung ah tungtuangmi ka koih ding; Judah in lei a let dia, Jakob in a sai a nawn ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Diktatna ah kituh unla, chitna bangzel in at un, na leileh lei uh satkham un; a hongpai a na tung ua diktatna a hon zuksak tan, Toupa zon hun ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Gitlouhna lei na let ua, thulimlouhna na lata uh; zuaugenna gah na neta ua; na lampi ah, na mihatte ah na muangta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huaiziak in na mite lak ah buaina a hongpawt ding a, na kulhte uh loh in a om ding hi, kidou lai a Salman in Betharbel a luh bang in; nu a tate toh paihnen in a om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Huchibang mah in na gitlouh mahmah ziak in Bethel in na tung ah a hih ding; nuaisiah in Israel kumpipa satkhiak siang in a omta ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel naupang a hihlai in, amah ka it a, Aigupta a kipan ka tapa ka sam khia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Amaute a sap chiang un, amau a kipan a pai gamla sem ua, Baal kiang ah a kithoih ua, lim bawltawmte kiang ah gimlim a hal uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hinapiin Ephraim pai ka kisinsak a; ka ban in amau ka pom a; himahleh amau ka hihdam chih a theikei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mihing khaute leh itna gui in amau ka kai a, amau adin a muk tung uleh a muk nuai ua kibat hakkol ka lakkhiaksak a, a ma uah an ka lui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aigupta gam ah a kiknawn kei ding a; himahleh Assuria mi a kumpipa ahi ding, kiknawn a nial ziak un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huan, a khopite tung ah namsau lik in a om dia, a siktawnte a hul in, a negai ding, a thuhilhte uh ngei ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huchi in ka mite’n kei a kipan nungtawn a tum chiltel uh; amah tung sang a ompa sam mahle uh, kuamah in amah a liansak kei ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ephraim, bangchi’n k’on tawpsan dia? Israel, bangchi’n k’on tankhe dia? Admah bang in bangchi’n k’on bawl dia? Zeboim bang in bangchi’n k’on koih dia? Ka sung ah ka lungtang a kilumlet a, ka lainatnate toh a kuang khawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka heh mahmahna ka suak khesak kei ding a, Ephraim hihse ding in ka kihei kei ding; mihing hilou in, Pathian ka hi a, nang lak a Misiangthou, khopi sung ah ka lut kei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amau Toupa deihdan in a om ding ua; Amah humpinelkai bang in a humham ding a, Amah humham ding a, huchi in tumlam a kipan tate ling kawm in a hongpai ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Aigupta a kipan a vasa bang in ling kawm in a hongpai ding ua, Assuria gam a kipan a vakhu bang in; a innte ua teng ding in amau ka bawl ding, Toupa’n a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ephraim in zuauthu in kei a hon umsuak a, Israel inkuan in khemna in; himahleh Judah in Pathian toh vai a hawmlaia, misiangthoute toh a ginom lai hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ephraim huih in a kivak a, suahlam huih a zui; zuaute leh siatgawpna a pungsak gige a; Assuria toh thukhun a bawl ua, Aigupta gam ah sathau puaklut in a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Toupa’n leng Judah a kiselpih a, a lampite bang in Jakob a gawt ding; a thilhihte bang in amah a thuk ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Sul ah a unaupa a khetul in a man a; a pichin in Pathian ah thilhihtheihna a nei hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ahi, angel tung ah thilhihtheihna a nei a, a vualzouta a; a kap a, a kiang ah thumna a bawl hi; Bethel ah Amah a mu a, huai ah kou a hon houpih hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Toupa mahmah, sepaihte Pathian, Toupa theihgigena ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huaiziak in nang na Pathian lamnga in; chitna leh vaihawmna kem in, na Pathian ngak nilouh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amah Kanaan mi ahi, a khut ah khemna buknate a om; nuaisiah a utlam ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ephraim in: “Taktak in ka hong hauta a, hauhsakna ka kimuhkhiakta hi; ka sepgimna tengteng ah thulimlouhna thilhihkhelhna kei ah bangmah a mu kei ding uh,” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Himahleh Aigupta gam a kipan kei Toupa na Pathian ka hi; Ankuanglui thupilai nite bang in, puaninte a teng ding in nang k’on bawllai ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />zawlneite kiang ah leng thu ka gen ta a, mengmuhnate ka tamsakta hi; zawlneite nasepna zang in kibatpihte ka zangta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Gilead thulimlouhna ahi hia? Bangmahlou ahivek uh; Gilgal ah bawngtalte in a kithoih ua; a maitamte uh loukaihna a leivup bang in a om uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Aram lou a Jakob a tailut bang in, Israel in zi loh ding in na a sem, zi loh ding in belamhon a ching hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Aigupta a kipan zawlnei in Toupa’n Israel a pikhia a, zawlnei a hawi in a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nakpi mahmah in Ephraim in Toupa a hehsak a; huaiziak in a sisan amah tung a nutsiat in a om ding, amah gensiatna Toupa’n a kiang lam ah a kiksak nawn ding.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ephraim in thu a genlai in, midangte ling uh a; Israel ah amah leh amah a kiliansak; himahleh Baal milim bia in, a sita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Huchi in a khial semsem ua, a dangka un milim sun a bawl ua, amau theihtheihna dungzui a milimte mahmah avek ua khutsiammite nasep; A kithoihmite’n bawngnoute tawp uhen chi in, huaite a tungthu a gen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huaiziak in zingsang meipi, daitui hulmang pah bang, phual a kipan a pingpei lak a buhsi bang a mut leng leh, meikhu suahna a kipan a meikhu bang ahi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hinapiin kei Aigupta gam a kipan Toupa na Pathian ka hi; kei loungal pathian na theikei ding, kei chih louh hondampa a omkei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Gamdai ah k’on theita a, khawkhalna gam ah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A loupa hing nou mitmet mun uh bang in, a maute hihdim in a om ua; hihdim in a om ua, huan a lungtang uh hihlet in a om; huaiziak in kei a hon mangngilhta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huaiziak in amau ading in humpinelkai bang ka hi a; gialbem bang in lampi kiang ah ka tang ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Vompi a noute sun bang in amaute ka maituah ding a, a lungtang ua kipan a lap uh ka kaikhe ding; huai ah humpinelkai bang in amaute ka nebei ding; gamsa bang in amaute ka botnen ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aw Israel, na panpihpa dou a, kei n’on dou, na siatna ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Na khopi tengteng a nang hon hondam ding na kumpipa tua kaw om ahia? Kumpipa leh hetute honpi un, na chihnate uh, na vaihawmmite uh koi ah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hehngoh in kumpipa ka honpia a, hehngoh in amah ka lamangta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ephraim thulimlouhna koihhoih in a om a, a khelhna chiamtehna a koih in a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Numei nauvei lungkhamna a tung ah a hongtung ding; tapa pillou suang ahi a, naupian hun tungta a, a mun a a omom ding ahita ngal kei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Han thilhihtheihna a kipan amau ka tan ding a; sihna a kipan amau ka tan ding; Aw sihna, na gu koi ah a om ua? Aw han, na hihsiatna koi ah a om a? Ka mit a kipan kisikna sel ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A unaute lak ah gahpha mahleh, suahlam huih a hong kuan dia, gamdai a kipan Toupa huih a hongnung dia, a tuinak a hong keu dia, a luikhuk a kangvek ding; bel kipahhuai tengteng a a gou loh in a om ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Samaria in a mawh a paw ding; a Pathian tung ah a hel a; namsau in a puk ding ua; a naungekte uh paihgawp in a om ding uh, nau toh kithuah a numeite uh dawt pailet in a om ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw Israel, Toupa na Pathian kiang ah kiknawn in, na thulimlouhna ah na pukta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Thupha tawi inla, Toupa kiang ah kiknawn in; “Thulimlouhna tengteng lamang inla, a hoihna na sang in; huchi in ka mukte uh thillat bawngtalte bang in ka pe ding uh,” a kiang ah chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Assuria in a hondam kei dia; sakolte tung ah i tuang kei ding uhi; i khut a bawlte kiang ah, pathiante na hi uh, i chi nawn kei ding hi; nang ah pabeite’n chitna a mu uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A ginomlouhna uh ka hihdam ding a, amaute a thawn in ka it ding, kei a kipan in ka hehna lah a kihei mangta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Israel lak ah daitui bang ka hi ding, lili bang in a paklun dia, Lebanon sing bang in zungkip a ka khesuk ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A hiangte a bawkpha dia, a kilawmna olive sing bang ahi dia, a gim Lebanon bang ahi ding hi
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A lim nuai a tengte a hong kik nawn ding ua, buh leh bal bang in a hong hingthak ding ua, grepgui bang in a paklun ding; a gim Lebanon uain bang ahi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Milimte bangding ka chi nawnta dia? Ephraim in a chi ding hi. Ka dawngkhin a, amah ka limsak ding, meilah sing hing bang ka hi a; kei a kipan na gah muh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kua ahia pil a, hiai thilte theithei ding? Pilvang a amaute thei ding? Toupa lampite a dik a, huaite ah mi diktat a om ding a; himahleh talekte huai ah a puk ding uhi.
  </para>
</usx>
